[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8829.429, "timestamp": "02:27:09", "text": "？ということで、これで終わりにしよう。えーと、何時だっけ？2時間28分。よし、あと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8832.309, "timestamp": "02:27:12", "text": "2試合。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8837.03, "timestamp": "02:27:17", "text": "あ、待って。ちょっと待って。28"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 8839.699, "timestamp": "02:27:19", "author": "@wildan19gta73", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_ltgSuqdkVmFy7b8YNX34dHb6whG0lODXr6m68zEAgk=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Like I said it is fine, I'm the type who would push streamer to do game i suggest because at the end of the day it their decision to try it or not"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8840.23, "timestamp": "02:27:20", "text": "。よし。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8842.79, "timestamp": "02:27:22", "text": "私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8844.71, "timestamp": "02:27:24", "text": "配信者にゲームをするように勧めるタイプなんだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8846.79, "timestamp": "02:27:26", "text": "。やってみる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8850.07, "timestamp": "02:27:30", "text": "かやらないか提案する。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 8851.36, "timestamp": "02:27:31", "author": "@wildan19gta73", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_ltgSuqdkVmFy7b8YNX34dHb6whG0lODXr6m68zEAgk=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "would not"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8853.75, "timestamp": "02:27:33", "text": "盛り上がっていた時はプレイしたかったんだけど。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8865.59, "timestamp": "02:27:45", "text": "えーと、盛り上がりは終わってた。今は盛り上がりはなくなってると思う。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8870.63, "timestamp": "02:27:50", "text": "それとも？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8874.07, "timestamp": "02:27:54", "text": "最近何が流行ってるかはよくわからない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8876.55, "timestamp": "02:27:56", "text": "けど。例えば、コールオブデューティがリリースされてる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8878.469, "timestamp": "02:27:58", "text": "から今流行ってるのは知ってる"}]